416
00:58:25,436 --> 00:58:27,803
<font color=#FFFF00><i>Senhoras e senhores,
eis Kerry Flynn!</i></font>

417
00:59:41,950 --> 00:59:43,650
<font color=#FFFF00>Pode me dar o de sempre?</font>

418
00:59:43,651 --> 00:59:44,951
<font color=#FFFF00>Claro.</font>

419
00:59:53,056 --> 00:59:54,865
<font color=#FFFF00>- Aqui.
- Obrigada.</font>

